  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-Service Teacher Education in Jordan (PRESTIJ)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(Jordan):  The GOJ is committed to better preparing teachers before they enter public school classrooms. The Pre-Service Teacher Education in Jordan activity will support a larger and more sustainable supply of certified Grade 4-10 school teachers in Jordan by institutionalizing best practices in pre-service teacher education in four public universities. Through this activity, USAID will provide technical assistance to public universities and relevant GOJ entities to scale up implementation of the pre-service teacher education modules as well as work with the GOJ to improve public perception of the teaching profession and support the GOJ on key reforms. ...</narrative>
  </description>
